CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_EeveeCanEvolveIntroThreeMons::
    .string "EEVEE can evolve into one of three\n"
    .string "kinds of POKéMON.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_OfferDomeFossil::
    .string "You're the Trainer who restored that\n"
    .string "OMANYTE, aren't you?\p"
    .string "We keep fossil specimens here for\n"
    .string "comparative research.\p"
    .string "One DOME FOSSIL is complete enough\n"
    .string "for restoration.\p"
    .string "A living POKéMON can teach us more\n"
    .string "than a specimen on a shelf.\p"
    .string "You've handled one restoration well.\n"
    .string "Would you take this one too?$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_OfferHelixFossil::
    .string "You're the Trainer who restored that\n"
    .string "KABUTO, aren't you?\p"
    .string "We keep fossil specimens here for\n"
    .string "comparative research.\p"
    .string "One HELIX FOSSIL is complete enough\n"
    .string "for restoration.\p"
    .string "A living POKéMON can teach us more\n"
    .string "than a specimen on a shelf.\p"
    .string "You've handled one restoration well.\n"
    .string "Would you take this one too?$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_ObtainedDomeFossil::
    .string "Obtained the DOME FOSSIL!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_ObtainedHelixFossil::
    .string "Obtained the HELIX FOSSIL!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_OppositeFossilAfterGift::
    .string "Bring it to the Restoration Room.\p"
    .string "They can process it the same way as\n"
    .string "your first fossil.\p"
    .string "Two ancient species alive together\n"
    .string "again... What an opportunity!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_OppositeFossilDecline::
    .string "All right. The specimen will remain\n"
    .string "here if you change your mind.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_OppositeFossilBagFull::
    .string "You'll need room for the specimen\n"
    .string "first.\p"
    .string "Come back when you can carry it\n"
    .string "safely.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchOffer::
    .string "I'm a geology student working with\n"
    .string "the CINNABAR LAB research team.\p"
    .string "Three pieces of my field equipment\n"
    .string "were swept out along the coast.\p"
    .string "I need the SAMPLE CASE, FIELD\n"
    .string "NOTEBOOK, and GEOLOGY KIT back.\p"
    .string "They're all beyond the shoreline, so\n"
    .string "you'll need SURF to reach them.\p"
    .string "Would you recover them for me?$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchAccepted::
    .string "Thank you!\p"
    .string "The SAMPLE CASE drifted toward a\n"
    .string "small offshore rock.\p"
    .string "The FIELD NOTEBOOK washed into a\n"
    .string "narrow inlet.\p"
    .string "The GEOLOGY KIT was last seen near\n"
    .string "an offshore rock cluster.\p"
    .string "Please bring all three back.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchNeedsSurf::
    .string "I'm preparing a coastal geology\n"
    .string "survey, but the sites are offshore.\p"
    .string "Come back once you can use SURF.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchDecline::
    .string "All right. I'll keep trying to map\n"
    .string "where the equipment washed up.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchActive::
    .string "I'm still missing the SAMPLE CASE,\n"
    .string "FIELD NOTEBOOK, and GEOLOGY KIT.\p"
    .string "They're scattered around CINNABAR's\n"
    .string "offshore rocks and inlets.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchReadyToReturn::
    .string "You found all three pieces!\p"
    .string "That saves my field study. I promised\n"
    .string "you a proper reward.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchReceivedEarthquake::
    .string "Here. TM17 contains EARTHQUAKE.\p"
    .string "And I have one more thing for you.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchBagFull::
    .string "I can't hand over the TM while your\n"
    .string "BAG is full.\p"
    .string "Make some room and come back.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchEggPending::
    .string "I still have the other part of your\n"
    .string "reward: a MAGBY EGG.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchNoPokemonRoom::
    .string "There isn't room for the MAGBY EGG\n"
    .string "right now.\p"
    .string "Make some space and come back. Your\n"
    .string "EGG will be waiting.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchRewardsComplete::
    .string "Take good care of that MAGBY EGG.\p"
    .string "Thanks again. With my equipment and\n"
    .string "samples back, the survey can go on.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchComplete::
    .string "The coastal survey is back on track.\p"
    .string "I couldn't have recovered all that\n"
    .string "fieldwork without you.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_LegendaryBirdEmail::
    .string "There's an e-mail message.\p"
    .string "… … …\p"
    .string "There are three legendary bird\n"
    .string "POKéMON.\p"
    .string "They are ARTICUNO, ZAPDOS, and\n"
    .string "MOLTRES.\p"
    .string "Their whereabouts are unknown.\p"
    .string "We plan to explore the cavern\n"
    .string "close to CERULEAN.\p"
    .string "From: POKéMON RESEARCH TEAM…$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_AnAmberPipe::
    .string "An amber pipe!$"

